    "Name": "Stone Giant SG11-Er",
    "Details": "The -Er is a recent refit of the SG11-E to focus more on firepower over ruggedness. By dropping the Binary Lasers in favor of Large Pulser Lasers managed to upgrade the MRM-10 to MRM-30 launchers and adding two ER Medium Lasers, and the Heavy Duty Gyro and Reactive Plating have been exchanged for weight saving options. The final change of the refit is the switch to Compact Heat Sinks.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Lifesupport</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.4</color></b>",
